===== shape coverage =====
# M3: explicit presence, as three cases and not one column
#   design/SHAPES.md: a by-value group reports absent and empty identically
#   unless it is designed not to. These are the three rows that say whether it
#   was. 200 elements; presence cycles per field and one element in seven is
#   present AND zero.

field                arm                absent   present+zero   present+nonzero  total
