#   All three cases occur on every field, so the shape is exercised and not
#   merely present. present+zero is the one a group cannot tell from absent
#   unless its presence WORD carries it, which is what makes these rows a test.

# M3: the oneof, by member

member                         count
as_int (int64)                    40
as_text (string)                  40
as_blob (bytes)                   40
as_stamp (message)                40
as_nothing (payload-free)         40
none set                           0

#   `as_nothing` is the payload-free member: present, empty, and selected by
#   its presence alone. It is 40 of 200 here, so it is reached.

